1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]$, find the distance $\\text{d}(a,b).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14044632/state.json" "file_sha256" "3f13ea6518011f995527c2cbfcbe84beaa89d5795a02cce6e033b41d0a26694f"} {"question" "q-139964" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the formula for the distance, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}(a,b) & =‖a-b‖ \\\\  & =\\sqrt{({a}_{1}-{b}_{1})^{2}+({a}_{2}-{b}_{2})^{2}+({a}_{3}-{b}_{3})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-5-3)^{2}+(0-1)^{2}+(3-(-1))^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-8)^{2}+(-1)^{2}+{4}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{64+1+16} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{81} \\\\  & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14044632/state.json" "file_sha256" "3f13ea6518011f995527c2cbfcbe84beaa89d5795a02cce6e033b41d0a26694f"} {"question" "q-139964" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14044632/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "589d7ba12e1dd64c8adb14c0668ccfde6c89b193b06b0e537a3101540f23b186"} {"question" "q-139964" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14044632/state.json" "file_sha256" "3f13ea6518011f995527c2cbfcbe84beaa89d5795a02cce6e033b41d0a26694f"} {"question" "q-139964" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "11"] ["math" "2\\sqrt{5}"] ["math" "3\\sqrt{6}"] ["math" "6"] ["math" "9"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14044632/state.json" "file_sha256" "3f13ea6518011f995527c2cbfcbe84beaa89d5795a02cce6